retired core additive.sub 2026-10-18 Sub became a LEVEL against the rest's energy (A-PH3), not a raise over the sound's own balance: additive.sub_level
retired core terrain.likes 2026-10-27 each like gained its engine and sound (backlog ON: likes leaked across engines): terrain.likes.v2
retired core terrain.likes.v2 2026-10-27 a like stores its 48-bin sixth-octave spectrum, not 12 harmonic magnitudes (the Hellinger fingerprint): terrain.likes.v3
retired core terrain.likes.v3 2026-10-28 a like stores its FULL POINT in its engine's triangle space, so its place follows a rotate, a gamma or a dial (backlog ON): terrain.likes.v4
retired core terrain.likes.v4 2026-10-28 a like stores its phase-warp angles as heard, which the P-MOBIUS likes fit reads: terrain.likes.v5
retired core terrain.likes.v5 2026-10-28 a like stores the angles of EVERY engine's sites (Stair, Resonate and the vowel joined the phase warp): terrain.likes.v6
retired core terrain.likes.v6 2026-10-31 a like stores the Karplus-Strong string's five material sites too (Pluck joined the phase warp): terrain.likes.v7
retired core terrain.likes.v7 2026-11-05 a like stores the drum engine's seven sites and, on Drum, its kind (the drum joined the phase warp): terrain.likes.v8
retired core vocode.freeze 2026-10-27 the engine vocoder's held envelope carries the right channel too (OE2 Stereo), a new layout: vocode.held
